@startuml 00-overview
!pragma layout smetana
' 只描述模块边界和依赖方向；每个运行期责任有自己的图。
title emuera 架构总览

package "Content" {
  [ERB / CSV / 编码输入] as ContentInput
  [ErbLoader] as Loader
}

package "GameData/ast" {
  [AstBuilder / LogicalLine] as AST
  [ParseDiagnostics] as Diagnostics
  [VariableTable / NameInterner] as Declarations
}

package "GameProc" {
  [EraEngine 装配] as Engine
  [EraParseTable 装载编排] as Table
  [loadpass / parsecheck] as Passes
  [ScriptRunner 步进] as Runner
  [SystemStateMachine 系统状态] as System
  [ExecutionEngine 指令语义] as Execution
}

package "GameData/Variable" {
  [VariableStorage 容器] as Storage
  [erasave::Map 条目映射] as SaveMap
  [EraBinaryData 文件格式] as Binary
}

package "GameView / QML" {
  [ConsoleBackend] as Console
  [SystemStatusManager] as Status
  [Console.qml / ConsoleInput.qml] as Qml
}

ContentInput --> Loader
Loader --> AST : source lines
Loader --> Table : scripts
AST --> Declarations : typed descriptors
Table --> Passes : ordered finalization
Passes --> Diagnostics
Table --> Runner : finalized lines
Engine --> Table
Engine --> Execution
Engine --> Runner
Engine --> System
Runner --> Execution
Runner --> System : frame-floor handoff
Execution --> Storage
System --> Storage : host callbacks
Storage --> SaveMap
Storage --> Binary
Execution ..> Console : output signals
System ..> Console : input requests
Console <--> Qml : properties / submissions
Engine --> Status : signal wiring

note right of Runner
  02-runtime-step：步进、调用栈、ExecState。
  03-runtime-system：系统状态、输入等待、帧节拍。
  04-runtime-console-qml：输出、输入桥接、QML 呈现。
  05-runtime-save-load：存档运行时集成。
end note

note bottom of Storage
  06-expression-ast：AST 结构。
  07-variable-resolution：名字到 locus 的唯一解析顺序。
  08-variable-storage：容器、几何和 save map。
  11-save-format：文件格式和版本兼容。
end note

legend bottom
  目录边界：Content 读入；GameData 保存值和结构；GameProc 驱动；
  GameView/QML 呈现；platform 管理窗口和系统集成；tools 提供协议服务。
endlegend
@enduml
